From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 20:03:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ec/lenovo/h8: Make the EC wake GPE configurable

The _PRW methods of the LID and SLPB devices hard-code GPE 0x18
(GPIO8), which is not where the EC wake signal is routed on every
ThinkPad. Add THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE, which mainboards can define like
THINKPAD_EC_GPE, and keep 0x18 as default. The default is set in
lid.asl and sleepbutton.asl, as some boards include lid.asl on its own.

No change for existing boards.

TEST=Built for lenovo/x230, lenovo/s230u and lenovo/t440p, the DSDTs
still use 0x18.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/lid.asl         | 7 ++++++-
 src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/sleepbutton.asl | 7 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/lid.asl b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/lid.asl
index 7695e4e5a..f70e3d614 100644
--- a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/lid.asl
+++ b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/lid.asl
@@ -1,5 +1,10 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only */
 
+/* GPE of the EC wake signal, mainboards can override it */
+#ifndef THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE
+#define THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE 0x18
+#endif
+
 Field(ERAM, ByteAcc, NoLock, Preserve)
 {
 		Offset (0x32),
@@ -21,7 +26,7 @@ Device(LID)
 
 	Method(_PRW, 0, NotSerialized)
 	{
-		Return (Package() { 0x18, 0x03 })
+		Return (Package() { THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE, 0x03 })
 	}
 
 	Method(_PSW, 1, NotSerialized)
diff --git a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/sleepbutton.asl b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/sleepbutton.asl
index 441dc65c9..e2dfc5eed 100644
--- a/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/sleepbutton.asl
+++ b/src/ec/lenovo/h8/acpi/sleepbutton.asl
@@ -1,5 +1,10 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only */
 
+/* GPE of the EC wake signal, mainboards can override it */
+#ifndef THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE
+#define THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE 0x18
+#endif
+
 Field(ERAM, ByteAcc, NoLock, Preserve)
 {
 		Offset (0x32),
@@ -14,7 +19,7 @@ Device(SLPB)
 	Name (_HID, EisaId ("PNP0C0E"))
 	Method(_PRW, 0, NotSerialized)
 	{
-		Return (Package() { 0x18, 0x03 })
+		Return (Package() { THINKPAD_EC_WAKE_GPE, 0x03 })
 	}
 
 	Method(_PSW, 1, NotSerialized)
-- 
